.env*

# CLAUDE.md files are local AI-assistant context by default. Two are
# deliberately tracked (2026-09-07) so the shareable repo guidance —
# conventions, verification recipes, tooling hazards — travels with a
# clone. Anything instructor-private belongs in CLAUDE.local.md, which
# is never tracked: this repo is public.
CLAUDE.md*
!/CLAUDE.md
!/weekly_reviews/CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md

# Instructor answer keys — untracked 2026-09-07. Kept on disk locally,
# never committed: this repo is public and students read it. The
# labNN_student.md companions stay tracked.
weekly_lectures/*/lab*_instructor.md

what_to_do.txt
what-to-do.txt
*.log
*.webarchive
.venv/
__pycache__/
.DS_Store

# Generated by weekly_lectures/week01 demo2_sql_basics/demo_2.py on every run
# (a COPY ... TO export and a persistent DuckDB save — both teaching outputs)
weekly_lectures/week01-database-foundations/demo2_sql_basics/expensive_products.csv
weekly_lectures/week01-database-foundations/demo2_sql_basics/shopmart.duckdb
